WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 9</i>

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.420
Yunxi.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.050
Coming of age is a major event in a girl's life.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.890
This is a gift I have prepared for you.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.800
These flowers are beautiful!

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.330
Master, what type of flower is this?

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.520
I have never seen it on Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.640
This is a phantasy ghost orchid.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:11.990
It does not grow on Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.770
Master...

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.840
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.400
Be quick, girls.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.300
Yes, mistress.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:38.610
Princess!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.370
Your Highness, please come with us.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.120
I'll go with you, but you must 
keep Que'er from harm.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.410
I understand.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.160
What are you doing?

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.930
L-L-Let me go!

00:02:56.770 --> 00:03:01.040
So why <i>are</i> you dressing me
 up like some strumpet?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.180
We are simply following orders.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:04.680
Continue.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:16.970
Ye Princely Palace

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:24.880
The answer to your question is in front of you.
Please step into the carriage, Your Highness.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.390
At least tell me where we're going.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.060
You will find out shortly.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.440
Where are you going?

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.310
Let me go.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.930
Why are you so arrogant? Put me down!

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.150
Is this not normal behavior
for a husband and wife?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.870
Ow! That hurts.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.910
You tryna hurl me off 
the Earth or something?

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.390
You asked to be put down.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:29.580
What now?

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.970
Do you wish me to carry you
 instead of getting down by yourself?

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:43.690
<i>It's weird...</i>

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.400
<i>I know he's a tomcat, but I still
 kind of enjoy the attention.</i>

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.560
Princess Palace

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.640
Why isn't Brother Ye here yet?

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.040
I am sure he will be here soon.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.700
Do not worry. He loves you the most. 
He will come, no matter how busy he is.

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:22.580
Brother Zimo, you're right.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.060
I wonder if he'll bring
 his princess with him...

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.660
His princess?

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.750
Ye Youming, that stony-faced wretch!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:34.770
I saw that girl first. He even
 promised to give her to me!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.520
And he went back on his word.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:43.110
Oh, hush up and move on. His Imperial Majesty
 arranged their marriage the official way.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.020
It had nothing to do with you from the start.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:50.190
<i>Brother Zimo is smitten 
with her? How interesting...</i>

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.830
<i>I want to see what kind of person she is—</i>

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.110
Announcing Prince Ye!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.630
Brother Ye!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.300
Brother Ye! You're here!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.580
Brother Ye, I've missed you so much!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.060
Check out my new Princess 
Palace. What do you think?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.180
If you like it, it is fine.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.060
Do not worry what others think.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.610
You know me best, Brother Ye.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:27.030
<i>Do you see? Our relationship is unbreakable.</i>

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.140
Who is that?

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.450
Lanshuang is our youngest sister.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.430
Brother Ye spoils her.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.840
You two. Keep up.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.680
Over here, Brother Ye!

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:43.560
Oh, we're a chair short.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.290
How careless of me.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:51.930
It was only the four of us in the past. 
I wasn't expecting an extra person today.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.180
It's fine. Just ask someone 
to bring another chair out.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:59.150
<i><i>This woman... Fine, if you 
want to take the high ground...</i></i>

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.920
They are in a relationship... 
His Imperial Majesty arranged the marriage...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.340
They are in a relationship... 
His Imperial Majesty arranged the marriage...

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.720
So, are you Brother Ye's favorite concubine?

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:17.060
I heard Brother Ye even ignores
 his new princess in favor of you.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.560
<i>His favorite concubine...</i>

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:24.050
<i>probably wouldn't sleep 
in the firewood storehouse.</i>

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:25.300
What are you saying?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.800
This is Princess Ye, the one you wanted to meet.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.040
She's the princess?

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:36.910
Sorry. I'm immature. I didn't expect Brother 
Ye to actually bring his princess here.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.810
Please don't take offense, Sister Princess Ye.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:45.180
If you didn't know, then you're not guilty
 of anything. It's only a title. I don't mind.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.680
<i>Traitor! You spoiled everything!</i>

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:55.120
Your Highness, the hall is ready.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.720
The banquet can start on time.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.800
Make sure everyone enjoys themselves.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.100
Is today a special day?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.940
Today is Lanshuang's birthday.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.490
And her coming-of-age ceremony.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.080
How time flies.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.500
<i><i>Coming-of-age ceremony...</i></i>

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:12.940
<i>Oh, right!</i>

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:15.930
Where's the toilet?

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.480
It's... over there...

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.610
Is she really the daughter 
of the Grand Councilor?

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:28.100
I can't believe she said 
a vulgar word like "toilet."

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.370
Princess Ye is special.

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:32.610
She is bold, forthright,
and good at martial arts.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.210
Like a heroine in a story.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.650
It is no wonder she even tamed Succubus.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.840
Succubus?! Impossible!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.560
Doesn't it only recognize 
Brother Ye as its master?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.270
Oh?

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:45.890
I did not know this.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:47.890
I witnessed it.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.040
Succubus behaved like 
a rabbit in her presence.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.060
Oh? Not bad.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.580
<i><i>Even though this girl kind of dislikes me, </i></i>

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:05.460
<i><i>Master said coming of age is 
a major event in a girl's life.</i></i>

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.560
<i>I'd better get her a gift.</i>

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.410
Oh, it's a flower fairy.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.740
Oh, it's a muggle, disturbing my rest...

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.430
You... You can see me?

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.310
Yeah. Can you do me a favor?

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:35.900
A favor?

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.810
Who the hell are you and why can you see me?

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.810
Oh, I see.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.660
Any friend of his is a friend of mine.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:52.980
So tell me, how may I help?

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:56.080
Today is the occupant's birthday.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.160
I want to give her a garland as a gift.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.660
Can you help me find some flowers?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.930
No sweat. What kind 
of flowers do you want?

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:04.890
Phantasy ghost orchids.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:07.700
Ph-Phantasy ghost orchids?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.480
Oh, yeah, you're a friend 
of Mr. Ling Qugu's...

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.200
Can you get them?

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.150
Well...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.810
Phantasy ghost orchids are magical, 
and only bloom once every thousand years.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.880
A little flower fairy like
 me wouldn't have any.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.110
Bloom once every thousand years?

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:26.870
Also, it only grows on Tuoai Cliff, and it's 
protected by the Busi demon all year round.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:28.680
Normal people can't get near them.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:32.210
<i><i>Master never mentioned this...</i></i>

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:35.070
However...

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.410
Even though I don't have 
phantasy ghost orchids,

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.990
I do have a birthday gift more
 suitable for the princess.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:47.080
These are Jizi orchids.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.750
Not as rare as phantasy ghosts, but a treasure 
all the same, only blooming every 300 years.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.320
The princess will love them.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.190
Thanks, little flower fairy!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:03.430
Lord Beitang, today is very important for us.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.500
You must follow my lead.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:07.310
I understand.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:13.900
Is that not Beitang Lie, 
the Western Tribe's champion?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.170
Why is he here?

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.160
He seems rather friendly with Qian Aotian.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:24.510
Qian Aotian, that sly old fox...
He does not even take care to hide now.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.770
Which reminds me... What is taking her so long?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.080
Did she lose her way?

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.380
Oh, there she is.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.810
Princess Ye! Over here!

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.560
What were you doing? What took you so long?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:44.880
Simply following orders. 
Your Highness will find out shortly.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:47.850
You...

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.940
This way, please.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:11:59.950
This way, my lord.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:00.930
Lord Sun, please sit here.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:22.650
Lord Situ presents a Hetian jade,

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:25.350
and wishes Princess Lanshuang good fortune.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:29.610
His Highness, the Crown Prince, 
presents a double phoenix

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.190
aromatherapy tube with 
golden silk inlaid with rubies,

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:35.020
and wishes Princess 
Lanshuang eternal youth.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.930
These gifts <i>are</i> precious,
but also kinda vulgar...

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:41.890
By the way, why isn't Brother Crown Prince here?

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.560
Your Highness, the Crown Prince is said 
to be ill and recuperating in his palace.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.520
His Imperial Majesty handed 
military affairs to Brother Ye,

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.220
and these weather vanes 
are also getting restless.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.500
We have a sensitive 
relationship with the West.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:00.610
All factions are trying to work out whether
 His Imperial Majesty favors war or peace.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.620
On the surface, it is the princess' party,

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.220
but their gifts to the princess 
are an attempt to curry favor.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:13.060
The person who should be most concerned
 about Brother Ye's military involvement is...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:21.040
Grand Councilor Qian presents a pair of 
double dragon coral bracelets in silver blue;

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:25.320
a crown in the shape of a phoenix spreading 
its wings, with jewels on six tines;

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:28.660
a golden ring with rubies and sapphires;

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.410
and one enamel flower hairpin.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.370
I wish you hundreds of blessings 
on your birthday, Your Highness.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.680
May your endless fortune bless this world.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.260
Behold his display of generosity.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:42.890
My gift is next.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:46.590
General Xuan presents a pair 
of koi carp with seven colors.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.610
What do you think?

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.390
They're great! I like them a lot!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:53.770
Take a look at my gift.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:57.630
Prince Yu presents a sewing set
 inlaid with emeralds,

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:01.770
and wishes for Princess Lanshuang 
to find love in short order.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:05.020
<i><i>Hateful! How dare you make fun of me!</i></i>

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.750
<i><i>I don't want to argue with you.</i></i>

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.800
<i><i>I wonder what Brother Ye will give me.</i></i>

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.770
My, what a priceless treasure!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.640
This is my first time laying eyes on it...

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.470
Is that the legendary...

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.160
Prince Ye presents the 
luminous pearl of nine colors,

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:27.790
and wishes the nation's pearl, 
Princess Lanshuang, eternal happiness.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.330
He's truly the one who loves me most!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:31.830
My son excels himself.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.640
Acquiring such a treasure 
is a feat in itself. Bravo.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.890
Your praise honors me, Father.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:41.810
Lord Beitang Lie of the Western Tribe

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.550
presents a brightly-colored 
glazed glass chalice.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.890
I broaden my horizons today.

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.750
Unbelievable generosity.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.370
That is the most prized treasure 
of the Western Tribe.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.450
A peace offering?

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.890
He has stolen the limelight from Brother Ye.

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:02.700
No matter how precious a gift is, it is worth 
less than one-millionth of Her Highness.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.160
On behalf of the Western Tribe,

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:07.640
I wish Princess Lanshuang a happy birthday.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.320
Well said!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.660
How can we not be joyful in welcoming
like-minded friends from distant lands?

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:23.390
We are exceedingly grateful for the 
sincere kindness of the Western Tribe.

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:27.450
Your Majesty, Lord Beitang 
has also come here today

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.470
in the hope of putting aside our 
differences and restoring relations.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:33.890
Since ancient times,

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.890
the Western Tribe and Central Plains 
have been branches of the same tree.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.850
Even if friction exists between us, 
as long as the misunderstanding is resolved,

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.390
we are still brothers.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.290
Lord Beitang is right.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:48.270
Your Majesty, should we—

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.210
Since all the gifts have been presented...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.280
Father, please instruct the banquet to begin.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.640
Lanshuang is also getting impatient.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.770
All right, let the banquet begin!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:01.770
Please wait.

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:13.240
Shang'er, how can you forget 
your place and be so rude?

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.200
Where is your gift to the princess? 
Why have you not presented one?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.890
Was your greedy mouth all you brought?

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:30.630
As if.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:34.220
I have a gift right here to 
present to Princess Lanshuang.
